@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### Create Fraud Analysis
POST {{baseUrl}}/fraud-analyses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "{{transactionId}}",
  "riskScore": 78.50,
  "riskLevel": "HIGH",
  "reason": "High-value transaction from an unfamiliar recipient."
}

> {%
  client.global.set("fraudAnalysisId", response.body.id);
%}

### Get All Fraud Analyses
GET {{baseUrl}}/fraud-analyses

### Get Fraud Analysis By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/fraud-analyses/{{fraudAnalysisId}}

### Get Analyses By Transaction ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/fraud-analyses/transaction/{{transactionId}}
